# Test artefacts generated by the e2e suite into the fixtures directory.
#
# `memory-retention.spec.ts` writes eight ~4 MB workbooks there, and
# `perf.spec.ts` writes a 100k-row CSV and XLSX. They are build products of a
# test run, not fixtures: they were committed by accident once (34 MB of them),
# and every suite run otherwise leaves the tree dirty, which makes it easy to
# sweep them into an unrelated commit.
#
# The checked-in fixtures (sample.docx, sample-multisheet.xlsx, ...) are
# deliberately NOT covered by these patterns.
tests/e2e/fixtures/mem-retention-*.xlsx
tests/e2e/fixtures/large-100k.csv
tests/e2e/fixtures/large-100k.xlsx
